<title>USA: General Cigar IPO slated for week of February 24.</title>
<headline>General Cigar IPO slated for week of February 24.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of General Cigar Corp has been tentatively scheduled for the week of February 24, according to lead underwriter Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette.</p>
<p>The business is being spun off from Culbro Corp.</p>
<p>No further details of the IPO were immediately available.</p>
